WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.483
SOURCE. The Sun shines over a classroom.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.824
SEE. A learner reads in daylight near a window.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.547
COMPARE. A torch lights up a dark room.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.336
SAFETY. Observe the daylight; never stare at the Sun.
